<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">复试自我介绍模板（中英双语）</view>
  <view class="section-subtitle">
    先确认分数段策略，再按模板替换关键词。建议中文稿先写，英文稿再对照补充，确保逻辑一致且便于临场切换。
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">分数段策略</view>
  <view class="card-grid">
    <block wx:for="{{scoreBandGuides}}" wx:key="key" wx:for-item="guide">
      <view class="card">
        <view class="tag {{guide.key === 'low' ? 'tag-warning' : ''}}">{{guide.title}}</view>
        <view class="card-body">{{guide.subtitle}}</view>
        <view class="list">
          <block wx:for="{{guide.actionSteps}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="step">
            <view class="list-item">
              <view class="list-dot {{guide.key === 'low' ? 'warning' : ''}}"></view>
              <view>{{step}}</view>
            </view>
          </block>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">双语段落模板</view>
  <view class="card-grid">
    <block wx:for="{{bilingualTemplate}}" wx:key="title" wx:for-item="section">
      <view class="card">
        <view class="card-title">{{section.title}}</view>
        <view class="card-body">
          <view class="tag" style="margin-bottom: 12rpx;">中文</view>
          <view>{{section.chinese}}</view>
          <view class="tag" style="margin: 20rpx 0 12rpx;">English</view>
          <view>{{section.english}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-card">
  <view class="section-title">临场彩蛋素材清单</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-body">
      <block wx:for="{{rehearsalChecklist}}" wx:key="*this" wx:for-item="item">
        <view class="list-item">
          <view class="list-dot"></view>
          <view>{{item}}</view>
        </view>
      </block>
      <blockquote>
        快速切换技巧：先用中文回答核心观点，再补一句英文总结亮点，例如“核心经验是…… In short, it proves my capability in …”。
      </blockquote>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
